{"3888300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dicefall", "steam_appid": 3888300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/08c33a8fd46dc116af24e8da2698af27.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1024 height=768 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Become a playtester!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/611a37cee37b74fbc4210ce36a503d01.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/611a37cee37b74fbc4210ce36a503d01.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/611a37cee37b74fbc4210ce36a503d01.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicefall is currently in the alpha phase. Help shape the future of the game and be one of the first to play!</p></p><br><h1>Funding</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is funded by the Film and Media Foundation NRW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/af083b277f9ed3f7a2bdd5429130e0c0.avif?t=1784558233\" width=242 height=72 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a 2D action RPG where you explore the metropolis of Dicefall and let the roll of the dice decide victory or defeat. Craft powerful dice, upgrade your abilities, make crucial decisions, and survive the city’s political power struggles to find your missing brother.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DICE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dicefall, dice determine your fate. Think about how to use them most effectively, because every roll is a chance, but also a risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUNES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, find, or loot powerful runes that completely change the properties of your dice! Use them to steer fate in your favor. But beware: Most runes come with a catch! You decide whether the risk is worth the reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME MORE POWERFUL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/c0271e6e8d270997b44b6abcd2a6ace4.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/c0271e6e8d270997b44b6abcd2a6ace4.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/c0271e6e8d270997b44b6abcd2a6ace4.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your skills and your dice, and combine runes into your own build. Piece by piece, you shape a character that fits your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PROBLEMS YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/02101516a30eaad46959e3a9d52c58c2.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/02101516a30eaad46959e3a9d52c58c2.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your words, pull some strings, lie, or throw some punches. You decide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/ab54077cbc8fc8d5d09257278e7c45bb.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/ab54077cbc8fc8d5d09257278e7c45bb.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/ab54077cbc8fc8d5d09257278e7c45bb.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Dicefall to your wishlist so you don't miss any news or updates, and to support a solo developer!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a 2D action RPG where you explore the metropolis of Dicefall and let the roll of the dice decide victory or defeat. Craft powerful dice, upgrade your abilities, make crucial decisions, and survive the city’s political power struggles to find your missing brother.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DICE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/982984204f1e3649e4327c79d348f6f4.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dicefall, dice determine your fate. Think about how to use them most effectively, because every roll is a chance, but also a risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUNES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.poster.avif?t=1784558233\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.webm?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/a0b04704673e4d9cee3ecd9ee5c48979.mp4?t=1784558233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, find, 